{
  "_readme": [
    "Scenario configurations for the MBO monetary policy model.",
    "",
    "EVERY NUMBER IN THIS FILE IS ILLUSTRATIVE AND NON-NORMATIVE. None of it is",
    "a policy proposal, a recommendation, or a protocol parameter. The values",
    "exist so the model can be exercised and so candidate policy families can",
    "be compared on identical assumptions.",
    "",
    "The one exception in provenance (not in status) is 'historical_documented',",
    "which reconstructs the emission schedule currently written in docs/. That",
    "schedule is documentation, not implemented behaviour: see the RFC baseline",
    "table. It is included so the documented plan can be compared against",
    "alternatives rather than assumed."
